1.1	By 2020, priority SDGs are identified and integrated into PQG
1.2.	By 2021, priority SDGs are identified and integrated in the annual Social and Economic Plan (Programa Econ&#xf3;mico e Social &#x2013; PES) and budget 
1.3.	By 2022, priority SDGs are identified and integrated into provincial plans and budgets
1.4.	By 2020, progress in the achievement of priority SDGs is tracked and assessed

Output 2:
2.1. By 2021, additional resources are dedicated to achieving progress in SDGs
2.2. By 2021, improve inclusion of all funds for financing for development in state budget and the SPO
2.3. By 2021, strategic partnerships are established, and programs/policies adopted for the achievement of priority SDGs for Cabo Delgado province 

Output 3:
3.1. By 2022, increase by 20 percent knowledge about SDGs of general public and media from 2018 level (53.1 percent and 40 percent respectively
3.2. By 2022, civil society organizations and parliament assessed progress</narrative>
